  // the kernel's initFeatureDB at taskpane_v3.js:186). Telemetry was
  // writing rows with {id:"_telemetry_..."} — eli.storage.put silently
  // rejected every write because the `key` field was undefined and
  // _saveRow's .catch(()=>{}) swallowed the error. NO telemetry data
